'''Zebak's Phantom''' is a monster encountered in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It is summoned alongside [[Ba-Ba's Phantom]] by [[Tumeken's Warden]] in the third phase of the final battle.

As a phantom of [[Zebak]], it will use its standard attacks to attack the player.

